ecific targeting!\n\nGameplay Mechanics:\n\nAim and throw with your VR controllers.\n\nYou must hit Male NPCs wandering the neighborhood only with Soccer Balls.\n\nYou must hit Female NPCs wandering the neighborhood only with Soft Pillows.\n\nThrow the wrong object at the wrong target, or miss, and you'll face a FAIL!\n\nWhy You'll Love It:\n\n\ud83c\udfaf Precise & Humorous Targeting: The matching mechanic adds a unique layer of humor and challenge to the game.\n\n\u2728 Low Poly Aesthetics: Visually pleasing with vibrant colors and a clean low-poly art style.\n\n\u23f1\ufe0f Fast-Paced Action: Test your reflexes and accuracy to achieve the highest score.\n\n\ud83d\udcc8 Replayability: Continuously hone your throwing skills to climb the leaderboards.\n\nAre you ready to take control of the chaos and become Throwtopia's Ultimate Thrower?", "short_description": "Throwtopia: Fun-Filled Chaos in a Virtual Neighborhood! Grab your VR controllers and test your throwing skills! Stop the chaos by hitting male NPCs with balls and female NPCs with pillows. Mix them up, and it's a FAIL! "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vQq7puLcjzcurpuqkiJsHh4n4ndgeRUXmBnCVVS49LRcU70cTaYV48LwTekpas10LA9JXheFViGyZuY/pub", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Taqo Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://secret-adjustment-848.notion.site/Taqo-Games-Official-Website-2ae914827180802ea420de23e9eb2d80?source=copy_link", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "su